{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "542dc061-b1f1-8665-ba26-2da1d56afa99",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:49:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Um, I'm calling about a pothole, a pretty bad one. Can you hear me okay? I'm on my cell and the signal's not great out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine so far. Go ahead and tell me about the pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I hit it on Wednesday evening and my tire blew right out. Completely flat. And the rim is bent, the mechanic said it's not something they can straighten, so I need a new wheel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. A blown tire and a bent rim. Where exactly is the pothole? What street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on Bliss Road, right near number 350. Three-fifty Bliss Road. It's [line breaks up] the bike lane, actually. Right in the bike lane, along the edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. Did you say it's right in the bike lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right in the bike lane. Along the edge where the paving's all broken up. A cyclist could go over the handlebars on it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:46:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I have three-fifty Bliss Road, a pothole in the bike lane. Is it on the Easton's Beach side of the road, or the other side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The beach side. Easton's Beach side, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And how big would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's about, um, [inaudible] wide, maybe a foot and a half across, and deep enough that you feel it in the whole car. It's been there a while, the edges are crumbling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me read this back so I have it right. Pothole in the bike lane at 350 Bliss Road, beach side, about a foot and a half across, and your tire blew and the rim was bent on Wednesday evening. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Hang on one second, my watch just buzzed, it's telling me I hit my step goal. Sorry about that. Okay, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Now, for the damage, I can put the report in for the road repair, and I can note that you had damage to your vehicle. Is there a number where we can reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0187. Okay. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara Almy. A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Almy. I'll get this to the road crew as a request for repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could I get a reference number for it? So I can show I reported it, and, um, follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me pull it up. [pause] Alright, I'm showing the request number as 2 6 0 1 4 7. Do you want me to repeat that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, I'll write it down. [line breaks up] Say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two, six, zero, one, four, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two, six, zero, one, four, seven. Got it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:48:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Any questions about the damage side of it, the office that handles those claims can tell you more, and I can give you their line if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine for now. I'll call back if I need it. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You take care, Ms. Almy. Have a good Friday."
    }
  ],
